slot. for Android: PokeDaisy's HUD menu and a Game Boy palette turned off.
- HUD: SCREEN EFFECTS (the HUD in the game's picture, through slot.'s shader
  and LCD Effect; the game's colours corrected before it goes in) and MINIMAP's
  opacity (100, 85, 70, 55 %, then OFF; 70 % by default).
- Its mGBA: a palette turned off shows at once (scripts/patch-mgba-gb-palette-off.py,
  the same change as slot.'s own mGBA).

